   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# AI Prompt Composer\n\nAn unbranded AI chat composer: the greeting and input ease in, a prompt types itself and the voice button morphs into the send button while the suggestion chips fade.\n\nCategory: ai. Length: 5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Showing a prompt-to-result workflow where a chat input is the entry point, without naming any AI product.\n- A prompt should type itself with the voice-to-send morph as the action beat.\n- A comparison or feature video needs an AI input card in your own colours.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The scene must show the answer as well: use ai-prompt-flow or agent-run.\n- The product is a command-line coding agent: use agent-terminal.\n- You only need a typed line with a caret and no app chrome: use caret or a typewriter text block.\n\nVariables:\n- greeting (string): Greeting, default \"What should we make?\"\n- placeholder (string): Placeholder, default \"Ask anything\"\n- prompt (string): Prompt, default \"Make a sunset over a calm ocean\"\n- app_label (string): App label, default \"Assistant\"\n- suggestions (string): Suggestions, default \"Create an image, Write or edit, Look something up\"\n- layout (enum): Layout, default \"card\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#6e56cf\"\n- theme (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  AI Prompt Composer\n\n  An unbranded AI chat composer: a greeting and the input ease in, the caret blinks, a prompt\n  types itself and the voice button morphs into the send button while the suggestion chips fade.\n\n  Adapted as an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from three remocn components that\n  share this motion (same intro, typing and voice-to-send morph; only their chrome differed):\n  https://github.com/Remocn/remocn/blob/126221ae00ba86eb40b65731b125ff398687d3b7/registry/remocn/chat-gpt/index.tsx\n  https://github.com/Remocn/remocn/blob/126221ae00ba86eb40b65731b125ff398687d3b7/registry/remocn/claude-chat/index.tsx\n  https://github.com/Remocn/remocn/blob/126221ae00ba86eb40b65731b125ff398687d3b7/registry/remocn/v0/index.tsx\n  The motion follows the source. The look was made generic: no product names, logos, model\n  names, signature colours or layouts; the app label, accent and theme are variables.\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) 2026 Remocn\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"ai-prompt-composer\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"greeting\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Greeting\", \"description\": \"Heading above the input. Leave empty to hide it.\", \"default\": \"What should we make?\"},\n    {\"id\": \"placeholder\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Placeholder\", \"description\": \"Muted hint shown in the empty input.\", \"default\": \"Ask anything\"},\n    {\"id\": \"prompt\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Prompt\", \"description\": \"Text that types itself into the input.\", \"default\": \"Make a sunset over a calm ocean\"},\n    {\"id\": \"app_label\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"App label\", \"description\": \"Name in the selector under the input (card layout only). Leave empty to hide it.\", \"default\": \"Assistant\"},\n    {\"id\": \"suggestions\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Suggestions\", \"description\": \"Comma-separated suggestion chips under the input; they fade out once typing starts. Leave empty to hide them.\", \"default\": \"Create an image, Write or edit, Look something up\"},\n    {\"id\": \"layout\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Layout\", \"description\": \"A card with a toolbar row, or a single-line pill.\", \"default\": \"card\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"card\", \"label\": \"Card\"}, {\"value\": \"pill\", \"label\": \"Pill\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"accent_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Accent\", \"description\": \"Colour of the send button.\", \"default\": \"#6e56cf\"},\n    {\"id\": \"theme\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Theme\", \"description\": \"Light or dark neutral theme.\", \"default\": \"light\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"light\", \"label\": \"Light\"}, {\"value\": \"dark\", \"label\": \"Dark\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"transparent\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Transparent\", \"description\": \"Leave the background clear so the composer sits over your own scene.\", \"default\": false},\n    {\"id\": \"speed\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Speed\", \"description\": \"Playback speed multiplier; above 1 the scene plays faster and holds the end.\", \"default\": 1, \"min\": 0.25, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 0.05}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>AI Prompt Composer</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n          background: var(--apc-page, #f4f4f6);\n          color: var(--apc-fg, #17171c);\n          font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n        #root * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .apc-clip { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\n        .apc-stage { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform-origin: 50% 50%; }\n        .apc-col { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .apc-heading { width: 100%; text-align: center; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--apc-fg); }\n        .apc-box { background: var(--apc-card); border: 1px solid var(--apc-border); transform-origin: 50% 0; }\n        .apc-card { border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 0 10px 34px -14px var(--apc-shadow); }\n        .apc-pill { height: 64px; border-radius: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 12px 0 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px -14px var(--apc-shadow); }\n        .apc-text { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; }\n        .apc-card .apc-text { padding: 24px 26px 8px; min-height: 92px; }\n        .apc-pill .apc-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; margin-left: 14px; height: 64px; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 19px; }\n        .apc-line { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }\n        .apc-pill .apc-line { flex-wrap: nowrap; white-space: pre; }\n        .apc-typed { color: var(--apc-fg); }\n        .apc-hint { color: var(--apc-muted); margin-left: 6px; }\n        .apc-caret { display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; width: 2px; height: 24px; border-radius: 1px; background: var(--apc-fg); }\n        .apc-pill .apc-caret { height: 22px; }\n        .apc-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 16px 16px; }\n        .apc-group { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n        .apc-ibtn { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--apc-border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .apc-plain { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .apc-model { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; height: 38px; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 19px; background: var(--apc-soft); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--apc-fg); white-space: nowrap; }\n        .apc-morph { position: relative; width: 42px; height: 42px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .apc-morph > div { position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .apc-voice { background: var(--apc-soft); }\n        .apc-send { background: var(--apc-accent); }\n        .apc-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; }\n        .apc-chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--apc-border); color: var(--apc-chip); font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap; background: var(--apc-card); }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"ai-prompt-composer\" data-duration=\"5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"apc-clip\" class=\"apc-clip clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"5\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"apc-stage\" class=\"apc-stage\"><div id=\"apc-col\" class=\"apc-col\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var stage = document.getElementById(\"apc-stage\");\n            var col = document.getElementById(\"apc-col\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() || {} : {};\n            var FPS = 30;\n            function num(v, d, min, max) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : d; }\n            function txt(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" ? v : d; }\n            function str(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; }\n            function colr(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() && window.CSS && CSS.supports(\"color\", v.trim()) ? v.trim() : d; }\n            function bool(v, d) { return v === true || v === \"true\" ? true : v === false || v === \"false\" ? false : d; }\n            function clamp(x, a, b) { return Math.min(b, Math.max(a, x)); }\n            // Damped spring 0 -> 1 from rest; frame in 30 fps frames (closed form of mass/stiffness/damping).\n            function spring(frame, c) {\n              var t = Math.max(0, frame) / FPS, w0 = Math.sqrt(c.stiffness / c.mass), z = c.damping / (2 * Math.sqrt(c.stiffness * c.mass));\n              if (z < 1) { var wd = w0 * Math.sqrt(1 - z * z); return 1 - Math.exp(-z * w0 * t) * (Math.cos(wd * t) + (z * w0 / wd) * Math.sin(wd * t)); }\n              if (z === 1) return 1 - Math.exp(-w0 * t) * (1 + w0 * t);\n              var s = w0 * Math.sqrt(z * z - 1), r1 = -z * w0 + s, r2 = -z * w0 - s;\n              return 1 - (r2 * Math.exp(r1 * t) - r1 * Math.exp(r2 * t)) / (r2 - r1);\n            }\n            // Linear fade-up over [a, b] frames: opacity 0 -> 1, 12 px rise.\n            function fadeUp(f, a, b) { var p = clamp((f - a) / (b - a), 0, 1); return { o: p, y: 12 * (1 - p) }; }\n            function svg(markup, size) {\n              return '<svg width=\"' + size + '\" height=\"' + size + '\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">' + markup + \"</svg>\";\n            }\n            var ICON = {\n              plus: '<path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>',\n              mic: '<rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M5.5 11a6.5 6.5 0 0013 0M12 17.5V21M9 21h6\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>',\n              wave: '<path d=\"M4 10v4M8.5 7v10M13 9v6M17.5 5.5v13M21 10.5v3\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>',\n              up: '<path d=\"M12 19V6M12 6l-6 6M12 6l6 6\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>',\n              chevron: '<path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>'\n            };\n\n            var greeting = txt(vars.greeting, \"What should we make?\").trim();\n            var placeholder = txt(vars.placeholder, \"Ask anything\");\n            var prompt = str(vars.prompt, \"Make a sunset over a calm ocean\");\n            var appLabel = txt(vars.app_label, \"Assistant\").trim();\n            var chips = txt(vars.suggestions, \"Create an image, Write or edit, Look something up\").split(\",\").map(function (s) { return s.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);\n            var layout = String(vars.layout) === \"pill\" ? \"pill\" : \"card\";\n            var accent = colr(vars.accent_color, \"#6e56cf\");\n            var dark = String(vars.theme) === \"dark\";\n            var speed = num(vars.speed, 1, 0.25, 4);\n            var T = dark\n              ? { page: \"#111114\", card: \"#1b1b20\", border: \"#2e2e36\", fg: \"#ededf2\", muted: \"#8b8b96\", chip: \"#b9b9c4\", soft: \"#2a2a31\", shadow: \"rgba(0,0,0,0.6)\" }\n              : { page: \"#f4f4f6\", card: \"#ffffff\", border: \"#e4e4e9\", fg: \"#17171c\", muted: \"#8b8b96\", chip: \"#5a5a66\", soft: \"#efeff3\", shadow: \"rgba(23,23,28,0.16)\" };\n            Object.keys(T).forEach(function (k) { root.style.setProperty(\"--apc-\" + k, T[k]); });\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--apc-accent\", accent);\n            if (bool(vars.transparent, false)) root.style.background = \"transparent\";\n\n            // Design box: 1280x720 for landscape hosts, 720x1280 for portrait, scaled to fit.\n            var W = root.clientWidth || 1080, H = root.clientHeight || 1920, portrait = H > W;\n            var RW = portrait ? 720 : 1280, RH = portrait ? 1280 : 720, k = Math.min(W / RW, H / RH);\n            stage.style.width = RW + \"px\"; stage.style.height = RH + \"px\";\n            stage.style.marginLeft = -RW / 2 + \"px\"; stage.style.marginTop = -RH / 2 + \"px\";\n            stage.style.transform = \"scale(\" + k + \")\";\n            var boxW = layout === \"pill\" ? (portrait ? 640 : 820) : (portrait ? 640 : 860);\n\n            function el(tag, cls, parent, html) { var e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html !== undefined) e.innerHTML = html; if (parent) parent.appendChild(e); return e; }\n            var head = null;\n            if (greeting) {\n              head = el(\"div\", \"apc-heading\", col);\n              head.textContent = greeting;\n              head.style.fontSize = (portrait ? 44 : 40) + \"px\";\n              head.style.padding = portrait ? \"0 40px\" : \"0 120px\";\n              head.style.marginBottom = (portrait ? 36 : 40) + \"px\";\n            }\n            var box = el(\"div\", \"apc-box \" + (layout === \"pill\" ? \"apc-pill\" : \"apc-card\"), col);\n            box.style.width = boxW + \"px\";\n            if (layout === \"pill\") { var pl = el(\"div\", \"\", box, svg(ICON.plus, 24)); pl.style.color = T.fg; pl.style.display = \"flex\"; }\n            var textEl = el(\"div\", \"apc-text\", box);\n            var line = el(\"span\", \"apc-line\", textEl);\n            var typed = el(\"span\", \"apc-typed\", line);\n            var caret = el(\"span\", \"apc-caret\", line);\n            var hint = el(\"span\", \"apc-hint\", line);\n            hint.textContent = placeholder;\n            var right;\n            if (layout === \"pill\") {\n              right = el(\"div\", \"apc-group\", box);\n              right.style.gap = \"8px\";\n            } else {\n              var bar = el(\"div\", \"apc-bar\", box);\n              var left = el(\"div\", \"apc-group\", bar);\n              var plus = el(\"div\", \"apc-ibtn\", left, svg(ICON.plus, 20)); plus.style.color = T.fg;\n              if (appLabel) {\n                var model = el(\"div\", \"apc-model\", left);\n                el(\"span\", \"\", model).textContent = appLabel;\n                var chev = el(\"span\", \"\", model, svg(ICON.chevron, 16)); chev.style.color = T.muted; chev.style.display = \"flex\";\n              }\n              right = el(\"div\", \"apc-group\", bar);\n            }\n            var mic = el(\"div\", layout === \"pill\" ? \"apc-plain\" : \"apc-ibtn\", right, svg(ICON.mic, 21)); mic.style.color = T.chip;\n            var morph = el(\"div\", \"apc-morph\", right);\n            var voice = el(\"div\", \"apc-voice\", morph, svg(ICON.wave, 22)); voice.style.color = T.fg;\n            var send = el(\"div\", \"apc-send\", morph, svg(ICON.up, 22)); send.style.color = \"#ffffff\";\n            var chipRow = null;\n            if (chips.length) {\n              chipRow = el(\"div\", \"apc-chips\", col);\n              chipRow.style.marginTop = \"24px\";\n              chipRow.style.maxWidth = boxW + \"px\";\n              chips.forEach(function (c) { el(\"div\", \"apc-chip\", chipRow).textContent = c; });\n            }\n\n            // remocn timing (30 fps frames, times speed): intro spring, staggered fade-ups,\n            // typing from frame 42 at 22 characters a second, morph spring from frame 42.\n            var TYPE_AT = 42, CPS = 22;\n            var INTRO = { damping: 14, stiffness: 110, mass: 0.7 }, MORPH = { damping: 14, stiffness: 200, mass: 0.6 };\n            var chars = Array.from(prompt);\n            function draw(f) {\n              var s = spring(f, INTRO), introY = 28 * (1 - s), introS = 0.97 + 0.03 * s;\n              if (head) { var h = fadeUp(f, 4, 20); head.style.opacity = h.o; head.style.transform = \"translateY(\" + (h.y + introY * 0.4) + \"px)\"; }\n              var b = fadeUp(f, 10, 26);\n              box.style.opacity = b.o;\n              box.style.transform = \"translateY(\" + (b.y + introY * 0.6) + \"px) scale(\" + introS + \")\";\n              var local = f - TYPE_AT, over = (chars.length / CPS) * FPS;\n              var count = local <= 0 ? 0 : clamp(Math.floor((local / over) * chars.length), 0, chars.length);\n              var typing = count > 0 && count < chars.length;\n              var m = clamp(spring(f - TYPE_AT, MORPH), 0, 1);\n              typed.textContent = chars.slice(0, count).join(\"\");\n              hint.style.display = count > 0 ? \"none\" : \"inline\";\n              caret.style.marginLeft = count > 0 ? \"2px\" : \"0\";\n              caret.style.opacity = typing ? 1 : Math.floor(f / 15) % 2 === 0 ? 1 : 0;\n              if (layout === \"pill\") {\n                var over2 = line.scrollWidth - textEl.clientWidth;\n                line.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + (over2 > 0 ? -over2 : 0) + \"px)\";\n              }\n              voice.style.opacity = 1 - m; voice.style.transform = \"scale(\" + (1 - 0.1 * m) + \")\";\n              send.style.opacity = m; send.style.transform = \"scale(\" + (0.8 + 0.2 * m) + \")\";\n              if (chipRow) { var c = fadeUp(f, 16, 32); chipRow.style.opacity = c.o * (1 - m); chipRow.style.transform = \"translateY(\" + (c.y + 8 * m) + \"px)\"; }\n            }\n\n            var seconds = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n            var clock = { f: 0 };\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.to(clock, { f: seconds * FPS * speed, duration: seconds, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.f); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"ai-prompt-composer\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
